Question 2 — npm scenario

A teammate clones a Node.js project. Its package.json contains:

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "check": "eslint src",
    "start": "node src/main.cjs"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "eslint": "9.0.0"
  }
}
```

The repository also contains a matching package-lock.json, but no node_modules directory. Node.js and npm are installed.

What commands should your teammate run to install the locked dependencies and then run the check script? Explain whether ESLint needs to be installed globally.

